    "hubspot_team_discount_form_8L6zpw": {
      "type": "hubspot-team-discount-form",
      "blocks": {
        "step_MQTQLM": {
          "type": "step",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "ACTIVATE YOUR TEAM'S 25% DISCOUNT",
            "content": "<p>We offer a 7-day, organization-wide 25% discount to help teams gear up for the season with Titan's industry-leading cut resistant base layers.</p><p>Complete the form below so we can connect with the appropriate person in your program and coordinate the discount window for your organization.</p>",
            "image_heading": "",
            "image_alt": "",
            "image_link": "",
            "footnote": ""
          }
        },
        "step_NTGYPh": {
          "type": "step",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "HELP US REACH THE RIGHT PERSON",
            "content": "<p>To activate the discount window, we need to coordinate with the person who can distribute the discount organization-wide.</p><p>If that's not you, share their details below and we'll take it from there.</p>",
            "image_heading": "",
            "image_alt": "",
            "image_link": "",
            "footnote": "<p><strong>If you selected “Yes,” copy and paste the template below and CC us.</strong></p><p>––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––</p><p><strong>CC: TeamSales@titanbattlegear.com</strong></p><p>Hi [Name],</p><p>I recently connected with Titan Battlegear about offering our organization a 7-day, site-wide 25% discount for all parents and players.</p><p>Titan has built the most protective baselayer on the market, and this would give all families in our program a chance to gear up at a meaningful savings.</p><p>They can set up a dedicated week-long discount window for us to distribute to the organization.</p><p>I’ve CC’d them here to make the introduction easy.</p><p>Would you be open to coordinating a discount week for the team?</p><p>Thanks,</p><p>[Your Name]</p><p>––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––</p>"
          }
        },
        "step_h37kbb": {
          "type": "step",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "CUSTOM TEAM BATTLEGEAR DETAILS",
            "content": "<p>We partner with organizations looking to raise the standard for player safety while outfitting their teams in custom Battlegear that reflects who they are and what they stand for.</p><ul><li>50-piece minimum order (MOQ)</li><li><strong>Logo usage approval + Vector logo required</strong> (.ai/.pdf/.eps/.svg)</li><li>Choose between a <strong>hosted team store</strong> (individual player ordering) or <strong>bulk invoicing</strong> (ship to organization)</li><li>Includes a <strong>25% sitewide discount window</strong> for your entire organization during a 2-week ordering period </li></ul><p><strong>To guarantee delivery before season start, orders must be finalized by June 1.</strong></p>",
            "image_heading": "",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/TITAN_HOSTED_TEAM_STORE_BANNER_3-1.webp",
            "image_alt": "",
            "image_link": "",
            "footnote": "<p>* Single-invoice bulk team order also available</p>"
          }
        },
        "step_TV9YAk": {
          "type": "step",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "COORDINATE YOUR TEAM'S DISCOUNT LAUNCH",
            "content": "<p>If you're managing the launch, you can confirm preferred timing below. If not, we'll connect with the appropriate leader and finalize the activation.</p>",
            "image_heading": "",
            "image_alt": "",
            "image_link": "",
            "footnote": ""
          }
        },
